{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Info</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game requires<u> two players</u></strong> and uses in-game voice chat for communication. No additional software is needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387160/extras/4e716b85e61b5370c912c38c4f5b229a.avif?t=1757923099\" width=612 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Locations, Connected by You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together in separate locations, each filled with unique puzzles that only your partner can help solve. Every move depends on sharp communication through in-game voice chat. Can you crack the code and escape before time runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387160/extras/d1daf14a92f13aa3187b95d97bd287c3.poster.avif?t=1757923099\" width=612 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387160/extras/d1daf14a92f13aa3187b95d97bd287c3.webm?t=1757923099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two-Player Co-Op: Work together from separate locations, using items and puzzles to help each other progress. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Storyline: Immerse yourself in a unique, fully voiced heist narrative. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-Game Voice Chat: Communicate like true professionals using an old-school walkie-talkie on a special, unhackable frequency. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmosphere? Explore a mysterious secret bunker that holds anything but the ordinary.</p></li></ul>","back